    icon masha size 150 set twemoji x 850 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 850 y 335 font_size 32 hidden true
    group speakers members ["tom","tom_name","masha","masha_name"] hidden true

    card title "I feel ill"

A: How do you say you're ill in Russian, and tell someone where it hurts?
    draw i_sore

B: У меня́ боли́т голова́.
    draw g_head

A: Word for word: by me hurts head, with the у меня́ of у меня́ есть.
    highlight g_head_w_1 g_head_w_2 color #c9871a effect underline

B: Боли́т is the verb, it hurts, with the ending of он говори́т.
    highlight g_head_w_3 color #3d8a5a effect glow part ит$

A: And голова́, the head, keeps its plain form: in Russian, the head does the hurting, not you.
    highlight g_head_w_4 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase i_sore g_head

A: Now the body, then how you feel, then where to get help. Голова́ is the head.
    draw body k_head l_head l_head_g

B: Го́рло is the throat.
    draw k_throat l_throat l_throat_g

A: Живо́т is the stomach, the belly.
    draw k_belly l_belly l_belly_g

B: And нога́ is the leg, and the foot too.
    draw k_leg l_leg l_leg_g

A: Each one drops into the same frame: у меня́ боли́т го́рло, my throat hurts.
    draw ow_throat f_throat

    erase ow_throat f_throat

B: У меня́ боли́т живо́т: my stomach hurts. Боли́т stays the same for each of these words.
    draw ow_belly f_belly

    erase ow_belly f_belly

    draw ow_leg

    quiz "Your leg hurts. Which is right?" store chk reveal.text "У меня́ боли́т нога́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 640 reveal.style label reveal.size 42 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b
        right: The leg does the hurting, so it stays plain: нога́.
        wrong: Ask who does the hurting: you, or the leg?
        * У меня́ боли́т но́гу.
        + У меня́ боли́т нога́.
        * Я боли́т нога́.

    highlight l_leg color #c9871a effect underline duration 1.2

    pause 1

    erase body l_head l_head_g k_head l_throat l_throat_g k_throat l_belly l_belly_g k_belly l_leg l_leg_g k_leg ow_throat ow_belly ow_leg f_throat f_belly chk_stamp

A: When you just feel bad all over, say how you feel: мне пло́хо, I feel ill.
    draw i_bad g_bad

B: Мне again, as in мне хо́лодно: the feeling goes to you, so not я пло́хо.
    highlight g_bad_w_1 color #c9871a effect underline

A: And when it's over: мне хорошо́, I feel fine.
    draw i_good g_good

    erase i_bad g_bad i_good g_good

B: Help comes from a врач, a doctor…
    draw i_doc n_doc

A: …or from the апте́ка, the pharmacy.
    draw i_pill n_pharm

B: To find one: где апте́ка? Where is the pharmacy?
    draw t_where

A: And the doctor asks: что у вас боли́т? What hurts?
    draw t_what

B: That's у вас, as in у вас есть ко́фе?
    highlight t_what color #c9871a effect underline part "у вас"

B: If someone looks ill, ask: вам ну́жно к врачу́? Do you need a doctor?
    draw g_need

A: That's ну́жно with the going left out; take к врачу́, to the doctor, as one phrase.
    highlight g_need_w_3 g_need_w_4 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase i_doc n_doc i_pill n_pharm t_where t_what g_need

B: Now Tom isn't well, and I ask him what hurts.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, что боли́т?","gloss":"Tom, what hurts?"},{"by":"a","text":"Голова́ и го́рло. Мне пло́хо.","gloss":"My head and my throat. I feel bad."},{"by":"b","text":"Тебе́ ну́жно к врачу́?","gloss":"Do you need a doctor?"},{"by":"a","text":"Нет, мне ну́жно в апте́ку.","gloss":"No, I need to go to the pharmacy."}] size 1.3

    draw talk

A: To что боли́т?, Tom just names the parts, plain.
    highlight talk_2_words color #c9871a effect glow part "Голова́ и го́рло"

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: В апте́ку has the у of direction, as in в шко́лу: Tom has to go there.
    highlight talk_4_words color #c9871a effect underline part "в апте́ку"

    erase talk

    hide speakers

    icon t1_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["face with head-bandage"] icon_look picture of "face with thermometer"

    quiz "Your throat hurts. Pick one." above t1_pic store q1 reveal.text "У меня́ боли́т го́рло." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Боли́т says it hurts; есть would only say you have one.
        wrong: Look for the word that means hurts.
        * У меня́ есть го́рло.
        * У меня́ нет го́рла.
        + У меня́ боли́т го́рло.

    pause 1.2

    erase t1_pic q1_stamp

    icon t2_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 530 or ["standing person"] icon_look picture of "person standing"

    quiz "What does живо́т mean? Pick one." above t2_pic store q2 reveal.text "живо́т = the stomach" reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Живо́т is the stomach, the belly.
        wrong: Живо́т was the label on the belly.
        + the stomach
        * the leg
        * the throat

    icon t2_ow size 40 set twemoji x 500 y 525 or ["anger symbol"] icon_look picture of collision

    pause 1.2

    erase t2_pic q2_stamp t2_ow

    icon t3_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["face with thermometer"] icon_look picture of "nauseated face"

    quiz "You feel ill. Tell a friend. Pick one." above t3_pic store q3 reveal.text "Мне пло́хо." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: The feeling goes to you: мне, as in мне хо́лодно.
        wrong: Start from мне хо́лодно, I'm cold.
        * Я пло́хо.
        * Мне хорошо́.
        + Мне пло́хо.

    pause 1.2

    erase t3_pic q3_stamp

    icon t4_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["man: beard","older man"] icon_look picture of "bearded person"

    quiz "Masha's brother has a stomach ache. Pick one." above t4_pic store q4 reveal.text "У него́ боли́т живо́т." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Боли́т takes the by-words, so he becomes у него́, as in у него́ есть брат.
        wrong: Боли́т never takes ему́; and who has the stomach ache?
        * Ему́ боли́т живо́т.
        + У него́ боли́т живо́т.
        * У меня́ боли́т живо́т.

    pause 1.2

    erase t4_pic q4_stamp

    icon t5_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["pill bottle"] icon_look picture of pill

    ask "Ask where the pharmacy is: Где … ? Type the missing word." above t5_pic answer ["аптека"] store q5 default апте́ка reveal.text "Где апте́ка?" reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Где апте́ка? Where is the pharmacy?
        wrong: The pharmacy is the апте́ка.

    pause 1.2

    erase t5_pic q5_stamp

    show s1_h s1 s2_h s2 s3_h s3

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So when you're ill in Russian, you're not the subject: the pain is by you, у меня́ боли́т, and the feeling goes to you, мне пло́хо.
    highlight s1 s2 color #c9871a effect underline

B: And for help, к врачу́ or в апте́ку.
    highlight s3 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase s1_h s1 s2_h s2 s3_h s3

B: Tom went to the апте́ка, and now ему́ хорошо́. Next time: whose is it? Пока́!
    icon e_face size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 540 or ["smiling face"] icon_look picture of "slightly smiling face"
    text e_line "Ему́ хорошо́!" #3d3833 say "Ему́ хорошо́!" say_voice b x 500 y 360 font_size 72

